WEBVTT

00:08.808 --> 00:16.850
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.850 --> 00:24.848
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.365 --> 00:36.169
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.169 --> 00:39.172
Believing, dreaming

00:39.172 --> 00:43.009
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.009 --> 00:48.140
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:49.949 --> 00:58.358
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.358 --> 01:02.929
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.929 --> 01:05.598
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.598 --> 01:13.873
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.873 --> 01:18.833
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.380 --> 01:27.013
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

02:33.753 --> 02:35.380
All tragedies...

02:36.422 --> 02:38.219
We meet again, eh?

02:39.592 --> 02:41.560
Do you like sad stories?

02:44.364 --> 02:45.661
Or maybe not.

02:49.302 --> 02:52.760
"Daffodils"...Wordsworth, huh?

02:57.677 --> 03:04.640
"Love sought is good, but
given unsought better."

03:05.952 --> 03:08.250
Shakespeare's "Twelfth Night."

03:08.721 --> 03:10.188
That's right!

03:14.727 --> 03:16.396
I'm sorry.

03:16.396 --> 03:18.198
Am I bothering you?

03:18.198 --> 03:19.995
It's nothing more than wishful thinking...

03:26.940 --> 03:28.567
Love.

03:29.976 --> 03:35.676
The 24th Night
The Shadow of Solitude

03:37.917 --> 03:40.044
Hey, Loki?

03:40.520 --> 03:41.487
Huh?

03:42.021 --> 03:45.479
You know... uh...

03:45.925 --> 03:47.222
Oh, never mind.

03:47.493 --> 03:51.264
Mayura, if there's something you
want to talk about, just say it.

03:51.264 --> 03:54.601
Okay. Well, you see, um...

03:54.601 --> 03:57.570
How can I put this? Uh...

03:58.004 --> 03:59.572
Out with it!

03:59.572 --> 04:01.199
Uh, right. Sorry!

04:04.677 --> 04:07.647
Master Loki, the preparations are in order.

04:07.647 --> 04:09.615
Please come out to the garden.

04:13.019 --> 04:14.953
Is something wrong?

04:15.822 --> 04:17.722
I guess I'll just come by later.

04:18.558 --> 04:19.855
Mayura?

04:22.695 --> 04:23.992
Master Loki, what...

04:36.943 --> 04:39.036
I can't ask him after all.

04:40.313 --> 04:41.780
Loki...

04:42.348 --> 04:43.975
No choice, huh?

04:46.786 --> 04:49.755
I can't ask him who he really is.

04:52.558 --> 04:54.560
Aren't we going to capture her?

04:54.560 --> 04:56.696
We'll be observing her for a little longer.

04:56.696 --> 04:58.031
Why?

04:58.031 --> 05:00.499
Because it looks like things
could get interesting.

05:03.636 --> 05:06.005
You're going to be just like me...

05:06.005 --> 05:07.807
and suffer greatly.

05:07.807 --> 05:10.503
I'll be fine. I'm used to it.

05:12.545 --> 05:13.671
Hel...

05:15.114 --> 05:17.582
Ooh, it's delicious! Delicious!

05:20.053 --> 05:22.722
This cake is delicious, Yamino!

05:22.722 --> 05:24.624
Ah, thank you.

05:24.624 --> 05:29.561
It certainly is. I have to hand it to you...
not that I want to.

05:30.697 --> 05:33.099
And this tea has such a pleasant aroma.

05:33.099 --> 05:36.466
It's a blend of assam and uva,
isn't it, Yamino?

05:36.703 --> 05:40.640
Yes. With just a hint of keemun
mixed in, as well.

05:40.640 --> 05:43.507
I'd acquired some high-quality teas
through mail order, so...

05:46.913 --> 05:51.475
Big brother, if you're hungry, there are
some sandwiches as well.

05:51.884 --> 05:53.886
Oh, yeah? That sure is nice of ya!

05:53.886 --> 05:55.854
They're on that table over...

06:07.900 --> 06:09.891
Bring out some more sandwiches, Four-Eyes!

06:12.705 --> 06:15.333
You dirtbags! You ate my sandwiches!

06:17.877 --> 06:22.081
Dear me. The appetites of Narugami and
his friend are rather surprising.

06:22.081 --> 06:24.049
Yamino, look.

06:33.593 --> 06:34.560
Daddy?

06:35.661 --> 06:36.787
Master Loki.

06:37.196 --> 06:38.831
Master Loki.

06:38.831 --> 06:40.799
Ah... hey, guys.

06:40.933 --> 06:43.060
Would you care for some more tea?

06:43.403 --> 06:45.098
Sure. Thanks.

06:49.409 --> 06:51.206
Is everything all right, Daddy?

06:53.246 --> 06:55.043
Can I ask you something?

06:55.948 --> 06:57.745
That shadow...

07:08.361 --> 07:12.388
You don't think it was... her, do you?

07:12.732 --> 07:14.165
"Her"?

07:14.534 --> 07:15.831
Hel.

07:16.335 --> 07:18.132
Hel? Our older sister?

07:18.571 --> 07:21.808
Back in the world of the gods,
I never did understand her,

07:21.808 --> 07:23.935
even though she was my own daughter.

07:24.744 --> 07:27.872
Or rather, I couldn't understand her.

07:28.080 --> 07:29.513
Master Loki...

07:30.349 --> 07:34.410
But now, since coming to this world,

07:35.154 --> 07:37.622
I think I've somehow come to
know how she feels.

07:40.560 --> 07:42.391
Yoo-hoo, Loki!

07:43.763 --> 07:45.231
Freya!

07:45.231 --> 07:47.131
Sorry I'm late.

07:48.000 --> 07:50.336
I brought some sweet, delicious yokan!

07:50.336 --> 07:51.997
Let's all dig in!

07:54.474 --> 07:55.771
Ow!

07:57.376 --> 07:59.173
Ouch...

08:00.046 --> 08:04.142
If I can't ask Loki directly, I'll just
have to look through his stuff.

08:04.550 --> 08:06.609
Like a detective!

08:08.955 --> 08:11.924
I'm sorry! It was spur of the moment!

08:15.027 --> 08:17.325
Jeez, it was just a bunch of dummies?

08:19.565 --> 08:22.398
There's way too much weird stuff
in this house!

08:25.204 --> 08:27.672
That yokan was so-so, huh?

08:28.207 --> 08:30.643
Daddy, was that really Hel?

08:30.643 --> 08:33.009
I don't believe it.

08:33.279 --> 08:34.576
I mean...

08:42.989 --> 08:46.720
Go now, to where your heart desires.

08:54.700 --> 08:56.668
The scent I smelled back then...

08:58.237 --> 09:00.006
Without a doubt, it was...

09:00.006 --> 09:00.907
Hel?

09:00.907 --> 09:01.737
Yeah.

09:04.176 --> 09:05.645
Pardon me.

09:05.645 --> 09:07.113
Are you in the middle of something?

09:07.113 --> 09:10.207
Huh? Oh... No, not really.

09:10.516 --> 09:13.519
It appears that some sort of event
is about to start.

09:13.519 --> 09:14.781
Event?

09:22.428 --> 09:23.827
A videotape?

09:24.797 --> 09:28.665
How suspicious!
Could it be a clue to Loki's secret?

09:29.135 --> 09:30.636
Without further ado,

09:30.636 --> 09:34.140
we bring you the "Are You Brave Enough?
Eatin' Hot Food and Lots of lt" contest!

09:34.140 --> 09:36.734
Would the participants each select
a piece of cake, please?

09:37.143 --> 09:38.911
Have you made your selections?

09:38.911 --> 09:41.480
Now then, some of these cakes are
mouth-scorching concoctions

09:41.480 --> 09:43.382
that have been baked with red pepper!

09:43.382 --> 09:47.250
Pepper notwithstanding, how many
plates can you stack up?!

09:47.687 --> 09:50.890
Urd will give you a new piece as soon
as you're ready for more!

09:50.890 --> 09:52.721
All right, let's get it on!

09:52.925 --> 09:55.061
Go for it, Fennie!

09:55.061 --> 09:57.063
Show 'em who's boss, Gullinbursti!

09:57.063 --> 09:59.759
And good luck to you too, Thor!

10:08.507 --> 10:10.771
Okay, get ready!

10:11.711 --> 10:13.144
Begin!

10:28.361 --> 10:30.158
And?

10:32.098 --> 10:32.298
Laugh Shop

10:32.298 --> 10:35.901
Laugh Shop
And then a chupacabra this big
came out of the hole.

10:35.901 --> 10:37.528
Laugh Shop
There's no way in hell!

10:39.505 --> 10:41.302
A chupacabra, he says!

10:42.541 --> 10:44.031
So it was a comedy video.

10:52.251 --> 10:55.550
Okay, that's all! And the winner is...

10:57.623 --> 10:59.591
Gullinbursti!

11:06.198 --> 11:08.029
Wather...

11:08.467 --> 11:11.527
Hey, Gulli, how about sharing some
thoughts on your victory?

11:21.313 --> 11:23.747
No clues here either, huh?

11:32.558 --> 11:35.026
Pudding! Don't mind if I do!

11:45.304 --> 11:46.931
Huh? It's open?

11:47.106 --> 11:47.902
Wince!

11:49.442 --> 11:50.909
And there's one missing!

11:51.110 --> 11:52.407
Double wince!

12:00.920 --> 12:04.083
It must have been big brother.
What am I going to do with him?

12:14.233 --> 12:15.700
That was a close one!

12:16.836 --> 12:20.439
Huh? Yamino just said "big brother."

12:20.439 --> 12:22.875
Is his older brother visiting or something?

12:22.875 --> 12:24.638
Whatever. Enough about that!

12:27.813 --> 12:29.582
Mmm, it's good!

12:29.582 --> 12:32.017
Nothing like a sugar rush to
clear the old noggin!

12:32.017 --> 12:35.748
Now then, if I want clues to help me
figure out Loki, I'll have to...

13:24.603 --> 13:26.230
No choice, huh?

13:46.859 --> 13:50.818
I feel like I've seen this somewhere before.

13:52.431 --> 13:53.830
What are you doing?!

13:54.834 --> 13:56.131
Loki!

13:58.070 --> 13:59.367
Mayura!

14:01.473 --> 14:05.077
If there's something you want to know,
why don't you just ask?

14:05.077 --> 14:07.170
How could you barge into my room like this?!

14:08.848 --> 14:10.145
Loki...

14:15.087 --> 14:19.717
I... I just wanted to know more about you.

14:20.226 --> 14:24.629
I saw your strange power and
I started to wonder.

14:24.997 --> 14:27.199
Mayura, I told you before!

14:27.199 --> 14:30.259
Meddling in other people's affairs out of
simple curiosity can be very dangerous!

14:30.536 --> 14:32.104
That's not it!

14:32.104 --> 14:35.207
It's not "curiosity" or anything like that!

14:35.207 --> 14:38.744
I... Well, I don't know why,

14:38.744 --> 14:43.374
but I feel like you're going to
go somewhere far away.

14:44.250 --> 14:45.547
That's why...

14:47.353 --> 14:48.650
I'm sorry!

14:55.194 --> 14:56.661
Master Loki...

14:57.096 --> 14:58.393
Mayura...

15:10.276 --> 15:11.777
Now I get it.

15:11.777 --> 15:14.746
This has become interesting,
just like you said.

15:15.414 --> 15:19.018
What's the matter? Things have
turned out the way you wanted.

15:19.018 --> 15:22.421
Loki is consumed with guilt about Mayura.

15:22.421 --> 15:26.687
If we steal her away, his suffering
will become even more intense.

15:27.793 --> 15:30.193
Why not look a little happier?

15:33.565 --> 15:36.602
I am delighted. From the bottom of my heart.

15:36.602 --> 15:39.628
I've just forgotten how to smile.

15:47.546 --> 15:51.346
I'll see you suffer even more, Father.

16:07.533 --> 16:09.660
I did a terrible thing.

16:14.039 --> 16:17.497
Mystery of the
wandering spirit.

16:18.277 --> 16:21.246
I'm telling you, I do think
it was wrong of me!

16:21.747 --> 16:25.150
Then please tell that to Mayura!

16:25.150 --> 16:26.777
Why can't I do it tomorrow?

16:27.219 --> 16:29.888
That's right! It doesn't have to be tonight.

16:29.888 --> 16:32.958
No, it does have to be tonight.

16:32.958 --> 16:35.483
Things like this need to be resolved quickly!

16:35.828 --> 16:39.457
That's wight, Loki! Poor Mayura...

16:39.798 --> 16:40.765
Aw, come on!

16:44.603 --> 16:47.071
Huh? Was this street a dead end?

16:47.439 --> 16:49.634
No, it wasn't.

16:49.808 --> 16:50.832
Loki!

16:51.643 --> 16:52.837
STOP

16:56.515 --> 16:57.812
Heimdall!

16:58.117 --> 16:59.675
So it was you.

17:00.019 --> 17:01.186
Loki...

17:01.186 --> 17:02.321
Why?

17:02.321 --> 17:04.482
I'm just repaying a debt.

17:04.690 --> 17:05.924
A debt?

17:05.924 --> 17:07.159
To whom?

17:07.159 --> 17:08.456
I think you know.

17:10.195 --> 17:11.719
So there you have it.

17:14.433 --> 17:15.491
Mayura!

17:21.173 --> 17:23.368
Mayura? Got a second?

17:25.444 --> 17:26.843
I'm coming in.

17:30.082 --> 17:31.674
Leave me alone!

17:31.950 --> 17:33.247
Mayura?

17:33.719 --> 17:35.016
Please.

17:39.491 --> 17:42.324
She's becoming more and more difficult.

17:45.964 --> 17:46.931
Mayura!

17:53.172 --> 17:54.867
Who the hell are you?!

17:57.142 --> 17:59.770
Give my daughter... Give Mayura back!

18:08.454 --> 18:09.955
Mayura...

18:09.955 --> 18:13.516
Cease your futile struggling.
If you value your life, that is.

18:13.759 --> 18:16.595
I don't care what happens to me!

18:16.595 --> 18:17.396
What?

18:17.396 --> 18:21.765
If it's a matter of protecting one's precious
daughter, a parent's life is of no concern!

18:23.202 --> 18:26.171
Not that I'd expect an evil spirit
like you to understand!

18:26.705 --> 18:28.297
Give Mayura back, damn you!

18:42.688 --> 18:43.985
Stop!

18:47.326 --> 18:48.725
Mayura...

18:54.099 --> 18:55.726
MAYURA!

19:03.442 --> 19:05.740
You're late. Did you run into trouble?

19:08.280 --> 19:10.182
Let's go, Heimdall.

19:10.182 --> 19:11.308
Hel!

19:15.053 --> 19:17.180
Is that you, Hel?

19:21.894 --> 19:22.883
Big brother!

19:28.534 --> 19:30.729
Daddy, it's definitely her.

19:31.370 --> 19:32.462
Hel!

19:34.740 --> 19:36.575
What do you plan to do with Mayura?

19:36.575 --> 19:38.277
She's got nothing to do with this!

19:38.277 --> 19:39.744
She does.

19:40.045 --> 19:42.848
This girl's tears will cause you pain.

19:42.848 --> 19:46.215
You will feel the pain of the heart, Father!

19:46.518 --> 19:47.485
Hel!

20:02.768 --> 20:03.602
Daddy!

20:03.602 --> 20:04.694
Loki!

20:05.037 --> 20:06.664
Master Loki.

20:19.618 --> 20:24.920
"My heart leaps up when I behold
a rainbow in the sky:"

20:26.558 --> 20:31.188
"So was it when my life began;
So is it now I am a man;"

20:32.331 --> 20:34.933
"So be it when I shall grow old"

20:34.933 --> 20:36.560
"Or..."

20:39.104 --> 20:41.800
"...let me die!" right?

20:43.041 --> 20:47.671
If it's a matter of protecting one's precious
daughter, a parent's life is of no concern!

20:51.950 --> 20:54.077
It's not too late to turn back, you know.

20:54.553 --> 20:56.388
What will remain?

20:56.388 --> 20:58.253
Nothing will remain.

20:58.590 --> 21:01.760
I am here because that is what I desire.

21:01.760 --> 21:03.595
I will let nothing remain.

21:03.595 --> 21:06.257
If you don't plan to cooperate, then leave.

21:08.100 --> 21:09.761
You don't have any regrets, do you?

21:10.869 --> 21:13.770
I have nothing left to lose.

21:14.373 --> 21:18.139
I have but one wish: the release of my soul.

21:19.211 --> 21:22.339
Die, Father.

21:23.515 --> 21:26.780
There's nobody else I can ask.

21:27.119 --> 21:30.088
It's sad to say, but I can't do anything.

21:30.489 --> 21:32.286
I'm her father, but I'm powerless.

21:35.060 --> 21:37.290
I'm begging you, Detective.

21:41.867 --> 21:44.165
I swear that I'll bring her back!

21:46.538 --> 21:47.664
Master Loki...

21:48.607 --> 21:51.405
Daddy, why is this happening?

22:00.152 --> 22:01.016
Hel...

22:16.835 --> 22:28.804
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.482 --> 22:42.227
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.227 --> 22:49.434
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.434 --> 22:55.774
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.774 --> 23:05.283
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.283 --> 23:09.621
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.621 --> 23:21.633
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.633 --> 23:23.362
Believe in Heaven

23:31.276 --> 23:32.210
Next Episode

23:32.210 --> 23:35.313
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode are
"solitude," "flower garden" and "one-way ticket."

23:35.313 --> 23:37.783
Next Episode
Hey, Urd, the harp is pretty difficult, isn't it?

23:37.783 --> 23:39.851
Next Episode
Anyone can learn to play,
as long as they are patient.

23:39.851 --> 23:40.852
Next Episode
You think so?

23:40.852 --> 23:42.587
Next Episode
Are there any instruments
that you play, Mayura?

23:42.587 --> 23:44.322
Next Episode
Ooh! I think I can play the pianica all right!

23:44.322 --> 23:46.858
Next Episode
Oh? If you can play the pianica,
you've already got a head start.

23:46.858 --> 23:48.193
Next Episode
The basics are the same for both instruments.

23:48.193 --> 23:52.297
Next Episode
Really?! So I can get on top of the harp
and slide down the back, right?

23:52.297 --> 23:53.965
Next Episode
"Slide down the back"?

23:53.965 --> 23:54.533
Next Episode

23:54.533 --> 23:55.033
Next Episode
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.033 --> 23:55.700
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.700 --> 23:56.101
The 25th Night
The Dream's Final Stop
Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:56.101 --> 23:57.702
The 25th Night
The Dream's Final Stop
"The Dream's Final Stop"

23:57.702 --> 23:59.538
The 25th Night
The Dream's Final Stop
Sounds like another strange mystery!

23:59.538 --> 24:01.028
The 25th Night
The Dream's Final Stop
